# Living Branches (WP Engine) — allowlist approach.
# Ignore everything, then re-include only the custom code we own.
# WP core, WP Engine mu-plugins, third-party/premium plugins, the parent
# theme, uploads, caches and DB dumps stay out of the repo.

/*
!/.gitignore

# wp-content: only custom code
!/wp-content/
/wp-content/*
!/wp-content/themes/
/wp-content/themes/*
!/wp-content/themes/Impreza-child/
!/wp-content/plugins/
/wp-content/plugins/*
!/wp-content/plugins/lb-shop-rules/

# Never commit, even inside allowed folders
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
.env
